      "batteries": {
        "main": {
          "note": "ONE shared 6S1P pack feeding all four motors, specified the way the label reads: 6S, 22.2 V, 5000 mAh, 0.025 ohm (= Example 4.6.1's Eb0=22.2 V, Rb=0.025 ohm). The loader divides pack values down to per-cell by cells_series/cells_parallel. For an 8S pack set cells_series=8; for more capacity raise cells_parallel (capacity adds in parallel; voltage in series). Each rotor draws ~2 A at hover (~8 A total); 20C * 5 Ah = 100 A limit. (For a real discharge curve, use a per-cell 'cell' block with cell_voltage/cell_capacity/cell_resistance + EA/EB/EC instead.)",
